<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:lrc="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" lrc:timing="Line" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><sourceMetadata xmlns="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">A side of you I hadn't known</text><text for="L2">Leaving me just like that</text><text for="L3">By the time our clasped hands turn</text><text for="L4">Cold, we've frozen over</text><text for="L5">Woo, woo</text><text for="L6">Woo, woo, woo, yeah</text><text for="L7">Closing my eyes now</text><text for="L8">I rewind you back again</text><text for="L9">Woo, woo</text><text for="L10">Woo, woo, woo, yeah</text><text for="L11">Like that, you disappear</text><text for="L12">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L13">You pass in reverse</text><text for="L14">Further back it goes, the more beautiful</text><text for="L15">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L16">I want to stay in that time</text><text for="L17">Although I know it's late</text><text for="L18">Answer me, are you going to</text><text for="L19">Keep suffocating me?</text><text for="L20">I say this is wrong</text><text for="L21">Many times over, but</text><text for="L22">It falls on deaf ears</text><text for="L23">Woo, woo</text><text for="L24">Woo, woo, woo, yeah</text><text for="L25">Closing my eyes now</text><text for="L26">I rewind you back again</text><text for="L27">Woo, woo</text><text for="L28">Woo, woo, woo, yeah</text><text for="L29">Like that, you disappear</text><text for="L30">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L31">You pass in reverse</text><text for="L32">Further back it goes, the more beautiful</text><text for="L33">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L34">I want to stay in that time</text><text for="L35">Although I know it's late</text><text for="L36">The minute joys I had all but forgotten</text><text for="L37">A massive mistake I wanted to erase</text><text for="L38">Back to that happy time before you left me</text><text for="L39">Even if I lose my present self, okay</text><text for="L40">Before the ending credits roll</text><text for="L41">Let's reshoot this movie from the beginning</text><text for="L42">Upset it all, suffice with every act with you</text><text for="L43">If I can't smile, the result is obvious</text><text for="L44">Edit, edit, edit, start with the first scene again</text><text for="L45">Let it, let it be, no, turn it back</text><text for="L46">Thread every mistake and somehow patch it up</text><text for="L47">Only you can fill me completely</text><text for="L48">It can't be beautiful, just burn it all</text><text for="L49">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L50">You pass in reverse</text><text for="L51">Further back it goes, the more beautiful</text><text for="L52">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L53">I want to stay in that time</text><text for="L54">Although I know it's late</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Joohyo</songwriter><songwriter>SUNMI</songwriter><songwriter>이토요</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L1">mi cheo  mol rat deon  ne  mo seup</text><text for="L2">geu reo ke  nal  du go  tteo na</text><text for="L3">ma ju  ja beun  du  so ni  cha gap ge</text><text for="L4">si geul  ttae jjeum  u rin  eo reo beo ryeo</text><text for="L5">u  u  u</text><text for="L6">u  u  u  ye</text><text for="L7">nun  ga ma  na  ji geum</text><text for="L8">neol  ga ma  na  da si</text><text for="L9">u  u  u</text><text for="L10">u  u  u  ye</text><text for="L11">geu reo ke  neon  sa ra jyeo ga</text><text for="L12">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L13">ne ga  geo kku ro  heul reo</text><text for="L14">heu reul su rok  a reum da wo</text><text for="L15">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L16">meo mu reu go  si peo</text><text for="L17">neu jeot dan  geol  al ji man</text><text for="L18">dae dap  jom  hae bwa  ja kku  nal</text><text for="L19">sum  mak hi ge  hal geo ya</text><text for="L20">i geon  jal mot doen  geo ra</text><text for="L21">myeot  beo neul  mal hae bwa do</text><text for="L22">deul ri jil  a na</text><text for="L23">u  u  u</text><text for="L24">u  u  u  ye</text><text for="L25">nun  ga ma  na  ji geum</text><text for="L26">neol  ga ma  na  da si</text><text for="L27">u  u  u</text><text for="L28">u  u  u  ye</text><text for="L29">geu reo ke  neon  sa ra jyeo ga</text><text for="L30">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L31">ne ga  geo kku ro  heul reo</text><text for="L32">heu reul su rok  a reum da wo</text><text for="L33">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L34">meo mu reu go  si peo</text><text for="L35">neu jeot dan  geol  al ji man</text><text for="L36">it go man  it deon  sa so han  haeng bok</text><text for="L37">ji u go  sip deon  keu na keun  jal mot</text><text for="L38">nal  tteo na gi  jeon  haeng bok haet deon  geu ttae ro</text><text for="L39">ji geum  nal  il ke  doen da  hae do  Okay</text><text for="L40">Before the  en ding  keu re dit</text><text for="L41">cheo eum bu teo  da si  jji geo  i  mu bi</text><text for="L42">da  eo peo  gi seung jeon  neo ro  jok hae</text><text for="L43">u seul  su  eop da myeon  gyeol gwan  ppeon hae</text><text for="L44">Edit, edit, edit  da si  cheot  ssin bu teo</text><text for="L45">Let it, let it be  a nya  doe dol ryeo</text><text for="L46">mo deun  jal mot  kkwe eo  eo tteo ke deun  me wo</text><text for="L47">neo ma ni  nal  ga deuk  chae wo</text><text for="L48">a reum da ul  su  eop dam  da  tae wo</text><text for="L49">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L50">ne ga  geo kku ro  heul reo</text><text for="L51">heu reul su rok  a reum da wo</text><text for="L52">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</text><text for="L53">meo mu reu go  si peo</text><text for="L54">neu jeot dan  geol  al ji man</text></transliteration></transliterations></sourceMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:33.480"><div begin="20.370" end="37.011" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.370" end="23.317" lrc:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">미처 몰랐던 네 모습</p><p begin="24.360" end="26.704" lrc:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">그렇게 날 두고 떠나</p><p begin="29.450" end="33.283" lrc:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">마주 잡은 두 손이 차갑게</p><p begin="33.300" end="37.011" lrc:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">식을 때쯤 우린 얼어버려</p></div><div begin="37.280" end="54.930" lrc:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.280" end="39.149" lrc:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우</p><p begin="39.260" end="42.240" lrc:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우 예</p><p begin="42.670" end="44.779" lrc:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">눈 감아 나 지금</p><p begin="45.010" end="47.016" lrc:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">널 감아 나 다시</p><p begin="46.390" end="48.203" lrc:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우</p><p begin="48.350" end="51.352" lrc:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우 예</p><p begin="51.830" end="54.930" lrc:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">그렇게 넌 사라져가</p></div><div begin="54.930" end="1:14.793" lrc:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="54.930" end="1:01.826" lrc:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</p><p begin="1:01.000" end="1:02.592" lrc:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">네가 거꾸로 흘러</p><p begin="1:02.610" end="1:04.923" lrc:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">흐를수록 아름다워</p><p begin="1:04.050" end="1:11.023" lrc:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</p><p begin="1:10.100" end="1:11.794" lrc:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">머무르고 싶어</p><p begin="1:11.698" end="1:14.793" lrc:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">늦었단 걸 알지만</p></div><div begin="1:24.360" end="1:41.129" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:24.360" end="1:27.399" lrc:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">대답 좀 해봐 자꾸 날</p><p begin="1:28.246" end="1:30.666" lrc:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">숨 막히게 할거야</p><p begin="1:33.550" end="1:36.319" lrc:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">이건 잘못된 거라</p><p begin="1:36.380" end="1:38.626" lrc:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">몇 번을 말해봐도</p><p begin="1:38.660" end="1:41.129" lrc:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">들리질 않아</p></div><div begin="1:41.280" end="1:58.900" lrc:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:41.280" end="1:43.060" lrc:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우</p><p begin="1:43.310" end="1:46.217" lrc:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우 예</p><p begin="1:46.660" end="1:48.755" lrc:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1">눈 감아 나 지금</p><p begin="1:48.980" end="1:51.011" lrc:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1">널 감아 나 다시</p><p begin="1:50.430" end="1:52.182" lrc:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우</p><p begin="1:52.353" end="1:55.353" lrc:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1">우 우 우 예</p><p begin="1:55.930" end="1:58.900" lrc:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1">그렇게 넌 사라져가</p></div><div begin="1:58.900" end="2:18.755" lrc:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:58.900" end="2:05.304" lrc:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</p><p begin="2:04.980" end="2:06.595" lrc:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1">네가 거꾸로 흘러</p><p begin="2:06.700" end="2:08.808" lrc:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1">흐를수록 아름다워</p><p begin="2:08.120" end="2:14.029" lrc:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</p><p begin="2:14.100" end="2:15.743" lrc:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1">머무르고 싶어</p><p begin="2:15.713" end="2:18.755" lrc:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1">늦었단 걸 알지만</p></div><div begin="2:27.300" end="2:36.298" lrc:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:27.300" end="2:29.453" lrc:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1">잊고만 있던 사소한 행복</p><p begin="2:29.490" end="2:31.754" lrc:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1">지우고 싶던 크나큰 잘못</p><p begin="2:31.850" end="2:33.997" lrc:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1">날 떠나기 전 행복했던 그때로</p><p begin="2:34.140" end="2:36.298" lrc:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1">지금 날 잃게 된다 해도 Okay</p></div><div begin="2:36.355" end="2:54.651" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:36.355" end="2:38.435" lrc:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1">Before the 엔딩 크레딧</p><p begin="2:38.700" end="2:40.678" lrc:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1">처음부터 다시 찍어 이 무비</p><p begin="2:40.960" end="2:42.982" lrc:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1">다 엎어 기승전 너로 족해</p><p begin="2:43.270" end="2:45.369" lrc:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1">웃을 수 없다면 결관 뻔해</p><p begin="2:45.500" end="2:47.721" lrc:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1">Edit, edit, edit 다시 첫 씬부터</p><p begin="2:47.850" end="2:49.777" lrc:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1">Let it, let it be 아냐 되돌려</p><p begin="2:49.840" end="2:51.620" lrc:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1">모든 잘못 꿰어 어떻게든 메워</p><p begin="2:51.861" end="2:53.006" lrc:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1">너만이 날 가득 채워</p><p begin="2:53.010" end="2:54.651" lrc:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1">아름다울 수 없담 다 태워</p></div><div begin="2:54.015" end="3:14.290" lrc:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:54.015" end="2:59.745" lrc:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</p><p begin="2:59.800" end="3:01.435" lrc:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1">네가 거꾸로 흘러</p><p begin="3:01.480" end="3:03.758" lrc:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1">흐를수록 아름다워</p><p begin="3:02.940" end="3:08.829" lrc:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1">Rewind, Rewind, Rewind</p><p begin="3:08.847" end="3:10.559" lrc:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1">머무르고 싶어</p><p begin="3:10.620" end="3:14.290" lrc:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1">늦었단 걸 알지만</p></div></body></tt>